<title>USA: White House says no U.S budget agreement yet.</title>
<headline>White House says no U.S budget agreement yet.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>White House spokesman Mike McCurry said on Friday there was no balanced budget agreement yet between the White House and the Republican-led Congress.</p>
<p>&quot;There's no deal without the president,&quot; White House spokesman Mike McCurry told reporters, saying that White House negotiators were expected to brief President Bill Clinton soon on their latest talks with congressional Republicans.</p>
</text>
